{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 A global master/slave transposition engine. Broadcasts pitch and scale changes across the entire project, manipulating both MIDI note data and real-time audio DSP seamlessly via global memory routing.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Inverts audio polarity in real-time when triggered by MIDI Channel 2 notes. Features a mathematical smoothing engine to prevent zero-crossing audio pops.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Toggles selected MIDI notes between Channel 1 and Channel 2. Designed as the companion script for the Yumyoo MIDI Phase Switch JSFX plugin to trigger per-note audio polarity inversion.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 A background script that monitors ReaSamplOmatic5000 instances. It automatically parses loaded sample filenames for musical keys (e.g., '808 [C#].wav') and calculates the exact mathematical offset to tune the sample UP to A4.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Yumyoo Toolkit\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 A collection of custom REAPER Lua scripts and JSFX built to streamline modern beatmaking, MIDI sequencing, and sampling workflows.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Included Tools\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b FL Studio-Style Auto Glide & Toggle:} A defer script and companion toggle action that brings native FL Studio-style overlapping note glide behavior directly into REAPER's MIDI editor. It automatically calculates and applies precise pitch bend messages between overlapping notes, optimized for 808s and synth leads.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Master Key Transposer:} A project-wide utility that allows you to globally manage, transpose, and shift the root musical key of your project across multiple MIDI items and tracks simultaneously.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b MIDI Phase Plugin & Toggle:} A JSFX and companion toggle script designed to flip the polarity/phase of a track directly at the instrument generation stage, allowing for quick phase alignment of layered synths or basses without needing to bounce MIDI to audio first.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b RS5k Root Note Finder:} A workflow enhancement for ReaSamplomatic5000 that automatically detects and assigns the correct root MIDI note for loaded samples, eliminating the need to manually pitch-match and tune imported one-shots.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Installation via ReaPack\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab Copy this repository URL:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi0 \f1 https://github.com/Yumyoo/Yumyoo-Toolkit/raw/master/index.xml\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab In REAPER, navigate to {\b Extensions} > {\b ReaPack} > {\b Import repositories}.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab Paste the URL and click {\b OK}.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 4.\tx360\tab Navigate to {\b Extensions} > {\b ReaPack} > {\b Browse packages}, search for "Yumyoo", right-click the scripts you want, select {\b Install}, and click {\b Apply} in the bottom right.\sa180\par}
}
